<mxCell id="n12" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16px&quot;&gt;•  Registers the company (RUC)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16px&quot;&gt;•  Employees request access&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16px&quot;&gt;•  The administrator approves or rejects&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16px&quot;&gt;•  Each person signs in with an account&lt;/span&gt;" style="text;html=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=16;fontColor=#1a1a1a;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;spacingLeft=0;spacingTop=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="302" y="182" width="345" height="190" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
